{"server":"jp","storyId":"act15d0_level_act15d0_07_beg","groupId":"act15d0","stageId":"act15d0_07","title":"裏切り","storyCode":"MB-7","avgTag":"戦闘前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act15d0/level_act15d0_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b293d223e24389404202ea7e80a70715dc088984d43202062807981908fd429c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミュルジス","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"おおっ！　これでようやく脱獄が実行されるのね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミュルジス","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"少し省略された部分もあるけど、でも全体の過程を見てみると想像してたよりもずっと複雑ね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミュルジス","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"ふわぁ……ちょっと眠くなっちゃったわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メイヤー","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"私もだよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"メイヤー","speakerId":"char_242_mayer","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、じゃあみんなにコーヒー淹れてくるね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サイレンス","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"もう少しで終わるよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミュルジス","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"わかってるわかってる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミュルジス","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"次に起きることは、あたしにも大体予想がつくわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミュルジス","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"すべての準備が整い、あとは脱獄を実行に移すその日を待つだけ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ミュルジス","speakerId":"char_249_muesys","isRemote":false,"text":"でも決行当日、あるメンバーが突然姿を消した――でしょ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サイレンス","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サイレンス","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"彼らは、監獄がニューライトバーグ市に停泊している間に、Cエリアの掃除に入るタイミングで脱獄を実行ことにした。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サイレンス","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"でもその日、約束の時間になってもロビンは現れなかった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サイレンス","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"彼らは知らなかった。実はこの計画が、陰に潜むジェッセルトンにすでに把握されていたことを。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サイレンス","speakerId":"char_108_silent","isRemote":false,"text":"そしてロビンは、彼らが必ず通るはずの道で待ち構えていた――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"ちょっとごたごたしてるけど、ひとまず計画を確認するよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"カフカたちは今みたいに、監房を掃除する隙を狙って入ってきて、君と一緒に囚人と看守をやっつける。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"はい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"そして監視カメラの向こう側にいる看守が反応する前に、カフカたち二人は塔の最上階へ向かって塔を沈め、監獄を停電させる。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"ドゥーマはすでに地下で待ってるから、彼女と合流して、一緒にトンネルに入る。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"最後に、ミナが盗んでおいてくれた職員の服に着替えて外に出れば脱獄成功だね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"ずっと疑問に思っていたのですが、私のような体格に合う職員の服は本当にあるのでしょうか。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"大丈夫だよ、ドゥーマがわざわざ縫い直してくれたんだから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"一着じゃ足りなくて二着を継ぎ合わせたんだ。チョー大きいよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"ちゃんとお礼言っといてね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"もちろんです。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"うぅっ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"じゃーねー！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"興奮しているようですね、ミス・カフカ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"へへっ、脱獄なんてこーんな楽しいこと、興奮するなっていう方が無理じゃん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"でも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"そういえば、ミス・ロビンが見当たりませんね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"今回の掃除もいつものメンツだ、そんなに説明する必要はないな？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"はーい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aエリア囚人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"看守さん、もし俺たちの中にまたアンソニーの旦那を暗殺しようとする奴がいたらどうするんだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"お前はバカか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"何のために今ボディーチェックをしたと思ってる？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守A","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"お前たちが素手でアンソニーさんを倒せるわけないだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bエリア囚人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"ハッ！　お前、そんなにアンソニーさんと勝負したいのか？　もしやるなら俺にも一声かけろ、応援くらいはしてやるからよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aエリア囚人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"消えろ、お前にゃ話してねえよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"（どういうこと？　なんでロビンが来てないの？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"ねえねえ、Aエリアのお兄さん、ロビンは？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aエリア囚人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"あぁ？　Bエリアの野郎は話しかけんじゃ……なんだ、カフカか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aエリア囚人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_132","isRemote":false,"text":"さぁな。朝から見つからなくてよ……だから俺があいつの代わりに来たってわけだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"そう……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"おい、無駄話は終わりだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"看守B","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"Aエリアの奴はあいつに、Bエリアの奴は俺についてこい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"チェッ、時間がないや。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"ロビン、ごめんよ。恨むなら来られなかった自分を恨んでね。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"……ここまで来てしまった以上、もう後戻りはできません。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"今後彼女に会えた時に謝りましょう。さあ、行きますよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"うん。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"ここがメインコントロール室か……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"げほげほっ……ホコリっぽーい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"危ない！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"え？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロビン","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"ロビン！？　なんでここに？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロビン","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"予備のカードがあるから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"カフカ","speakerId":"char_214_kafka","isRemote":false,"text":"予備？　どういう――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ロビン","speakerId":"char_451_robin","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bエリア囚人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Bエリア囚人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_133","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"下がっていてください。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"……私たちは急いでいます。今は話している時間などありません。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"アンソニー","speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","isRemote":false,"text":"すぐ終わらせましょう。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_108_silent","aliases":["サイレンス"]},{"speakerId":"char_214_kafka","aliases":["カフカ","看守"]},{"speakerId":"char_242_mayer","aliases":["メイヤー"]},{"speakerId":"char_249_muesys","aliases":["ミュルジス"]},{"speakerId":"char_264_Mountain","aliases":["アンソニー"]},{"speakerId":"char_451_robin","aliases":["ロビン"]}]}
